/*
  Flappy Night theme - the FlappyCoin city and bushes after dark, under a
  crescent moon and the stars (drawn in code). Pipe green frames and title
  tabs, orange buttons, and Flappy Bird yellow totals.

  The layout is res/flapxcoin.qss, below its variables; the base colours come
  from the theme table in guiutil.cpp.
*/

